nd enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n{\n  \"persona\": {\n    \"name\": \"Mira Kovač\",\n    \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n    \"city\": \"Ljubljana\",\n    \"bio\": \"I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.\",\n    \"availability\": \"Open to freelance work from January\",\n    \"email\": \"mira@example.com\",\n    \"links\": [\n      \"Dribbble\",\n      \"LinkedIn\",\n      \"Read.cv\"\n    ],\n    \"stats\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Years designing\",\n        \"value\": \"10\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Products shipped\",\n        \"value\": \"24\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"People reached\",\n        \"value\": \"1.2M\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"Interaction design\",\n      \"User research\",\n      \"Design systems\",\n      \"Prototyping\",\n      \"Service design\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"projects\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Transit app redesign\",\n      \"year\": 2026,\n      \"role\": \"Lead designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Ljubljana Public Transport\",\n      \"summary\": \"Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"mobile\",\n        \"research\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinic booking system\",\n      \"year\": 2025,\n      \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Zdravje Clinics\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"web\",\n        \"service design\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open data dashboard\",\n      \"year\": 2024,\n      \"role\": \"Design and front-end\",\n      \"client\": \"City of Ljubljana\",\n      \"summary\": \"City budget explorer used by 30k residents.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"data viz\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"testimonial\": {\n    \"quote\": \"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\",\n    \"author\": \"Tina Zupan\",\n    \"role\": \"Head of Digital, LPP\"\n  }\n}","systemHash":"7f7b03405c279f095db892fdd24437dfc241ff3c8abb65e91da9e557823238ce","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"row between center\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;\">\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">MK</div>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-weight:650;\">Mira Kovač</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Product designer · Ljubljana</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">Open to freelance work from January</span>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">Email me</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Calm, usable software for public services and small teams.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">I'm Mira, a product designer in Ljubljana. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping — most of it spent on services that people use because they have to, and should still enjoy.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">Get in touch</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"#\">Dribbble</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"#\">Read.cv</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Years designing</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">10</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">Since 2015, in-house and freelance</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Products shipped</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">24</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">Web, mobile and internal tools</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">People reached</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">1.2M</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">Riders, patients and residents</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">What I do</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"max-width:70ch;\">I work end to end: framing the problem with the people affected by it, then designing and prototyping the thing that fixes it.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Interaction design</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">User research</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Design systems</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Prototyping</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Service design</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"between row center\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Selected projects</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Three recent engagements across transit, healthcare and open government data.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\" id=\"filters\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-filter=\"all\">All</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-filter=\"mobile\">mobile</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-filter=\"research\">research</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-filter=\"web\">web</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-filter=\"service design\">service design</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-filter=\"data viz\">data viz</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\" id=\"projects\">\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-tags=\"mobile research\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2026</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Lead designer</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Transit app redesign</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">Ljubljana Public Transport</div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n          <strong class=\"small\">Outcome</strong>\n          <div class=\"small\">App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">mobile</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">research</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-tags=\"web service design\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2025</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Product designer</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Clinic booking system</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">Zdravje Clinics</div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n          <strong class=\"small\">Outcome</strong>\n          <div class=\"small\">58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">web</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">service design</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-tags=\"data viz web\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2024</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Design and front-end</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Open data dashboard</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">City of Ljubljana</div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">City budget explorer used by 30k residents.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n          <strong class=\"small\">Outcome</strong>\n          <div class=\"small\">Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">data viz</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">web</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"filter-note\">Showing all 3 projects.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Rider app rating, before and after</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">App store rating for the Ljubljana Public Transport app, on a 5-point scale.</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"App store rating\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Before\",\"value\":3.4},{\"label\":\"After 6 months\",\"value\":4.6}]}'></div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">+1.2 points — from 3.4 to 4.6.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">What clients say</div>\n      <blockquote style=\"margin:0; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.5;\">\n        &ldquo;Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.&rdquo;\n      </blockquote>\n      <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\">TZ</div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Tina Zupan</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">Head of Digital, LPP</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <footer class=\"between row center\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:600;\">Mira Kovač</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">Product designer · Ljubljana · mira@example.com</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">Dribbble</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">LinkedIn</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">Read.cv</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var filters = document.getElementById('filters');\n    var cards = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#projects article'));\n    var note = document.getElementById('filter-note');\n\n    filters.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n      var btn = e.target.closest('button[data-filter]');\n      if (!btn) return;\n      var f = btn.getAttribute('data-filter');\n\n      Array.prototype.forEach.call(filters.querySelectorAll('button'), function (b) {\n        b.className = 'btn btn-sm' + (b === btn ? '' : ' btn-outline');\n      });\n\n      var shown = 0;\n      cards.forEach(function (card) {\n        var tags = card.getAttribute('data-tags').split(' ');\n        var match = f === 'all' || tags.indexOf(f) !== -1;\n        card.style.display = match ? '' : 'none';\n        if (match) shown++;\n      });\n\n      note.textContent = shown === 0\n        ? 'No projects match that tag yet.'\n        : 'Showing ' + shown + ' of ' + cards.length + ' projects' + (f === 'all' ? '.' : ' tagged “' + f + '”.');\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[1635,"<div"],[1646," class=\"page stack"],[1650," gap"],[1662,"-lg\">\n  <header class"],[1662,"=\"row between center"],[1664,"\" style=\"flex"],[1671,"-wrap:wrap;"],[1678," gap:12"],[1681,"px;\">\n    <div class"],[1690,"=\"row center"],[1696," gap-sm\">\n      <div"],[1703," class=\"avatar\">MK"],[1705,"</div>\n      <div>\n"],[1715,"        <div style"],[1718,"=\"font-weight:650"],[1723,";\">"],[1728,"Mira Kova"],[1736,"č</div>\n        "],[1740,"<div class=\"small"],[1745," muted\">Product designer · Lj"],[1755,"ubljana</div>\n     "],[1763," </div>\n    </div"],[1766,">\n    <div class=\""],[1775,"row center"],[1806," gap-sm\""],[1807," style=\"flex-wrap:wrap"],[1807,";\">\n      <span"],[1808," class=\"badge\">"],[1808,"Open to"],[1809," freelance work"],[1812," from January</span>\n     "],[1835," <a class=\"btn btn"],[1835,"-secondary btn-sm\" href=\""],[1835,"mailto:m"],[1838,"ira@example.com\">Email"],[1841," me</a>\n    "],[1844,"</div>\n  </header"],[1855,">\n\n  <hr"],[1857,">\n\n"],[1862,"  <section class=\"stack"],[1868," gap"],[1873,"-sm\">\n    <h"],[1883,"1>Cal"],[1886,"m, usable"],[1890," software for public"],[1896," services and small"],[1903," teams."],[1923,"</h1>\n    <p"],[1923," class=\"lead\">I'm"],[1924," Mira,"],[1926," a product designer in"],[1940," Ljubljana. Ten"],[1943," years across research, interaction"],[1944," design and front"],[1953,"-end prototyping — most"],[1964," of it spent"],[1971," on services"],[1981," that people use"],[1982," because"],[1987," they have"],[1994," to,"],[2003," and"],[2009," should"]